        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>CompX C8076-14A, Keyed Cam Cabinet or Drawer Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Cam Cabinet Lock is designed to lock cabinet doors or drawers with lipped/overlay construction with a maximum thickness of 7/8\".  For overlay application the combined thickness of front and frame cannot exceed the length of the 1-3/16\" cylinder.  The lock can be ordered keyed alike or keyed differently and is packaged with 2 keys, trim washer, spur washer, mounting nut, two cams, and two stop washers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Cam Cabinet and Drawer Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cam Type: Straight</li>\r\n<li>Cam Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cam Offset: 11/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cam Rotation: 90° or 180° CW/CCW</li>\r\n<li>Hand: Reversible</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Material Thickness: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder Type: 5 Disc Tumbler</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><b>Polished Nickel Finish</b></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
